+/**
+ * Hot reload builds (#29): the slots a function body keeps by position, in source order: every call to a `remember*` function,
+ * to `Composer.cache` and to a generic @Composable, with the callee, its type arguments and its parameter count.
+ * Part of the hot reload group key, so a change of a remembered type, of the number or the order of `remember`
+ * calls gives the function a new group (its state resets) instead of handing an old slot value to new code that
+ * expects another type (Kotlin/Native does not check such casts). Nested functions and lambdas have their own keys.
